 "notes": [
  "Track is one 8-bar hook looped until 106.5s, then a short tail; band energies repeat to 0.19 dB on average every loop, so there is no level-based intro/build/drop in the audio.",
  "librosa's default tracker reports 79.5 BPM (it locks onto a syncopated 3/16 figure); the fitted 8th-note grid gives 119.64 BPM with 4.1 ms RMS error over 195 onsets.",
  "Intro / build / drop / break / outro are therefore created in the mix by filter and level automation on this measured grid. The 808 lands on the downbeat (low-band flux), so D and U are placed on 808 downbeats at phrase starts."
 ]
}